{
  "bookId": "hero-214104",
  "id": "bond-28590",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28590001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "嘿！守规矩的人类，欢迎来到爱丽丝的收藏室！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28590002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "哇！突然出现！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28590003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "吓到了吗！吓到了吧哈哈哈！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28590004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "原来是爱丽丝，怎么了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28590005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "没生气啊？果然还是有点无聊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28590006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你叫我过来之前，我就有心理准备了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28590007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "切~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28590009",
              "text": "这是你的秘密收藏室吗？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28590009",
              "text": "谢谢爱丽丝愿意邀请我。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28590008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28590009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "嘻嘻，一会儿可不要吓到啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28590010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "啊？究竟是什么收藏品……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28590011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "锵锵~这是兔子先生和玫瑰小姐。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28590012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "兔子先生真可爱，呃……但是耳朵断了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28590013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "这是名为断耳兔子的收藏品，我的力作。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28590014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "玫瑰小姐的颜色真好看，欸？这是白油漆涂在了红玫瑰上！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28590015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "特制油漆，在皮肤上不容易掉色哟！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28590016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "看样子，爱丽丝的收藏品都很与众不同呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28590017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "爱丽丝",
          "text": "当然啦~而且……我觉得你也很特别！要不要也变成爱丽丝的收藏品呀？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28590018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "哈哈……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
